        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The charts give information about world forests in five different regions. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OV2jd25XFozKkVxnELgl6lbHgT1\"><em><strong>The charts give information about world forests in five different regions.</strong></em><strong> </strong><em><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - World Forests by Region</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RR8UdVFbQoYRe4xkNdIliXlQgCh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i World Forests by Region y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả th&ocirc;ng tin về rừng thế giới ở năm khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLZDdAaDBokUrbxTdHvlkNNmgJg\">Paraphrase đề World Forests by Region với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ rừng - sản lượng gỗ - 5 khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng </strong><strong>viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZYcKds0cxoRKAhxeacalnMrzg7b\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 1 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZYcKds0cxoRKAhxeacalnMrzg7b\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HwnPdro5Oo13tuxLKqQl7slvgkf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Differences</strong>: Africa v&agrave; North America c&oacute; diện t&iacute;ch rừng gần tương đương nhưng sản lượng gỗ ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n tr&aacute;i ngược | Africa: diện t&iacute;ch rừng lớn nhất nhưng sản lượng thấp nhất | North America: diện t&iacute;ch rừng lớn thứ 2 nhưng sản lượng cao nhất</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Africa v&agrave; North America</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<ul>\n<li>(Step 1) M&ocirc; tả <strong>Africa c&oacute; diện t&iacute;ch rừng lớn nhất </strong>(27%) nhưng <strong>sản lượng thấp nhất</strong> (9%)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q8gidmol6o3pZqxnrTvlgnu2gBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) M&ocirc; tả <strong>North America c&oacute; diện t&iacute;ch rừng lớn thứ 2 </strong>(25%) nhưng <strong>sản lượng cao nhất </strong>(30%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxyddQEhcoY8KWxvzb7lDuisgNd\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong> <strong>South America, Europe, v&agrave; Asia</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<ul>\n<li>(Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh sản lượng gỗ</strong> của 3 khu vực c&ograve;n lại (South America 23%, Europe 20%, Asia 18%)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9uvdWHiDoU1ZpxkrxZlU45ug6O\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh diện t&iacute;ch rừng</strong> của 3 khu vực n&agrave;y (Europe 18%, South America 16%, Asia 14%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi diễn đạt \"sản lượng gỗ\" m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c cụm từ như \"timber production\" v&agrave; \"lumber output\" để tăng sự đa dạng nh&eacute;.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JwmQdZxc9o0s8Exp9lJlJRX7gXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The given pie charts illustrate the percentage of forests in 5 different regions globally, and their <strong>timber production</strong>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JwmQdZxc9o0s8Exp9lJlJRX7gXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Although Africa has the largest forested areas in the world (27%), its <strong>lumber output</strong> is the lowest, at only 9% of the global production.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
